# libedit (sqlite3, lldb, python from uv, psql when built with it): vi mode as in zsh. No jj: libedit has no
# timeout for a key sequence, so a j followed by any other letter is lost; Esc leaves insert mode.
# Linked to ~/.editrc by setup_readline (zsh/functions/readline.zsh); see docs/vim-keys.md, "Each tool".
bind -v
